  characterName: "Mwanajuma Hassan \u25CF \u25CF \u25CB"
  promptText: Child, I live in Mohamed's village. Industrial trawlers came this week,
    dragging chains across our reef. Suddenly the souvenirs look like a small problem.
  leftAnswer: Rally the village. Together you are harder to ignore.
  rightAnswer: Hold back. Armed crews are not worth lives
